# Project language

Native Chinese is fine for thinking. Split by audience so nothing is bilingual-and-stale.

| Surface | Language |
|---|---|
| Git commits | English (Angular; see `commit-messages` rule) |
| Code comments | English, why only; skip what the name already says |
| `README`, public API docs | English |
| `docs/` design, RFCs, construction notes | Chinese |
| PR title | English, same as the commit header |
| PR / issue discussion | Chinese until non-Chinese collaborators exist |

Do not keep parallel EN/ZH copies of the same doc. Translate a design doc to English only when it becomes public or a collaborator cannot read Chinese.

